t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">剪映发布全新AI能力：专业版上线剪映Hub，移动端推出AI助手小映</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">上纬启元发布Q1与T1人形机器人，搭载自研260克鸡蛋关节</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI、Anthropic及DeepSeek等十余款大模型将于双节前后密集发布</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阶跃全量开放Step 5 Preview模型：600B稀疏MoE架构仅激活27B</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/21c648715dd3c4007778cb5b5a9cc5ea.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阶跃正式全量开放新一代旗舰基座模型Step 5 Preview，该模型专为Agentic任务设计，采用稀疏MoE架构，总参数量600B，每次推理仅激活27B。模型原生支持100万Token上下文窗口，并具备多模态输入能力。在Artificial Analysis的Intelligence Index中，其得分位列全球开源模型前三，单任务成本仅为Claude Opus 5的八分之一。在ALE-CLI、FrontierFinance及DRACO等高难度基准测试中，表现仅次于GPT-6 Astra或Claude Opus 5。在长周期任务实验中，Step 5 Preview在24小时内自主优化MLA GPU内核，峰值性能达508 TFLOPS，超越Claude Opus 5的493 TFLOPS。此外，该模型在编程、</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信AI团队开源知识管理框架WeKnora 0.8.0，支持沙箱执行技能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3ab5fee05d3a5c9c09aa9954906e4498.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微信AI团队正式开源知识管理框架WeKnora 0.8.0版本，该框架采用MIT协议，旨在解决大模型落地中知识库仅能检索无法执行的痛点。核心功能包括：anydoc解析支持PDF、Word、Markdown等多种格式直接导入，并结合GraphRAG技术将文档转化为结构化知识图谱，提升复杂关联问题的回答准确度。最关键的创新在于Skill Sandbox Runtime，允许将知识库内容封装为“技能”，并在Docker、E2B或CubeSandbox等沙箱环境中安全执行，实现从“建议方案”到“可验证结果”的闭环。此外，WeKnora还集成了长期记忆功能，采用模块化架构，支持从个人到企业的多种应用场景，为开发者提供了一套完整的解析、组织、检索、执行及记忆处理方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">剪映发布全新AI能力：专业版上线剪映Hub，移动端推出AI助手小映</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1c075a7726f3ec4ed87744056cf1f609.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">剪映在“AI新创作发布会”上推出多项AI功能，正式发布专业版工作台“剪映 Hub”、智能创作Agent“剪映助手”及移动端AI助手“小映”。此次更新旨在打造覆盖全场景的智能创作平台，其中“剪映 Hub”作为一站式工作台，配合新上线的“AI Ultra会员”，进一步强化了专业创作能力。移动端AI助手“小映”则支持多种创作场景，并具备AI营销专家功能。在创作者生态方面，剪映升级了“剪同款”范式，推出“模板作者AI助手”、激励计划及“剪映创作合伙人”计划，通过技术与服务双重升级，助力不同阶段创作者提升生产效率。此次发布标志着剪映从单一剪辑工具向全场景智能创作平台的战略转型，通过引入Agent技术和专业级工作台，显著降低了专业创作门槛，并为创作者提供了更完善的商业化与技术支持体系。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">上纬启元发布Q1与T1人形机器人，搭载自研260克鸡蛋关节</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d4a75f8e20753c660876c6ffb27c71a5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">9月20日，上纬启元正式发布启元Q1与启元T1两款人形机器人。启元Q1定位个人机器人，身高88厘米，支持外观结构件定制及性格、语音自定义；启元T1则支持轮足与四足形态切换，为全球首个可变形个人机器人。硬件核心在于自研的“鸡蛋关节”，该关节重量仅260克，直径47毫米，峰值扭矩密度达85N·m/kg，属行业量产体积最小级别。生态方面，启元机器人与腾讯云达成合作，两款产品正式接入WorkBuddy，成为首个接入该平台的具身智能企业。上述产品已于8月23日开启预订，标志着消费级人形机器人在形态可变、外观定制及AI能力开放接入方向的进一步探索。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI、Anthropic及DeepSeek等十余款大模型将于双节前后密集发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">双节前后全球AI行业迎来密集发布期，包括OpenAI、Anthropic、DeepSeek及阶跃星辰在内的多家厂商将推出超10款大模型。OpenAI计划补齐GPT-6全系产品，包括Sol、Terra及Luna版本；Anthropic将跳过5.1版本直接发布Opus 5.2与Fable 5.2。国内方面，阶跃星辰Step 5 Preview已率先上线。DeepSeek备受关注的V4.1 Pro预计将采用CED架构，参数量有望冲击3万亿级别。此外，阿里Qwen4系列、Kimi K3.1、小米Mimo V2.6、智谱GLM-5.5及MiniMax M3.1等模型均在排队发布中。此次密集更新涵盖了从万亿参数旗舰到本地部署小模型的全产品线，行业竞争焦点已转向架构优化与参数规模的进一步突破，这对大模型市场的算力需求及应用落</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
